DTEND:20260914T123342Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:17:46 and reappears at 17:59:54 IST\, se
 en from Anand.\nThe Moon is 37° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +19°.\nTi
 mes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's
  edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Anand
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Anand
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
